    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "LOUIS F. SWIFT\nPRESIDENT\nPERCY LISA\nGEO.H.CHAPMAN\nSECRETARY\nSOUTH SAN FRANCISCO\nLAND AND IMPROVEMENT COMPANY\nINDUSTRIAL AND RESIDENTIAL PROPERTIES\nJanuary 10, 1927•\nSAN FRANCISCO\nMERCHANTS EXCHANGE BUILDING\nSOUTH SAN FRANCISCO\nOFFICE\nGRAND AND LINDEN AVENUES\nMr. P. R• Inompson, Manager,\nDear Sir:\nWith reference to the establishment of a temporary\nLand ing Ileld at south san francseo, pending the selection\nI a permanent tield, we are agreeable to permitting you to\noffer to the City of\nSan Franciso for temporary use the site\nwest of the new Bay Shore Highway, the exact descript im of\nwhich you are familiar, at a price of $900.00 as rental for\nthe period ending December 31, 1927, without any obligation\non the part of the City of San Francisco to accept as a pe -\nmanent field the location which has been offered to them.\nWe also agree to extend to the City of San Fran-\ncisco an option on the 221.4 acres of land esst of the Bay\nShore Highway, designated as Field No. 2 in the Report of\nthe San Francisco Chamber of Commerce, at a pric of $1784.10\nper acre, or a total consideration of $395,000.00.\nThe cost of this option to be 1% of the purenase\nus by the City of\nprice of the land, 059500 in the rate it to d t\nis not exercised within the period stated; nanely, December\n31, 1921•\nIf, however, the option is exercised, and the land\npurchased at the price named, land option price will be applied\non the purchase price of the\nVery truly you\nSHAW\nGENERAL MANAGER\nPJS: M"
